module.exports = [{"item_id":73,"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"There are now rumblings that Apple might soon invade the smart watch space, though the company is maintaining its customary silence.","question":"Which market is Apple rumored to enter?","options":"Smart watches|Self-driving cars","correct":"Smart watches","audio_file":"73_FILLER.mp3"},{"item_id":74,"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"A bill was drafted and introduced into Parliament several times but met with great opposition, mostly from farmers.","question":"Who hates the bill most?","options":"Construction workers|Farmers","correct":"Farmers","audio_file":"74_FILLER.mp3"},{"item_id":75,"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"The human body can tolerate only a small range of temperature, especially when the person is engaged in vigorous activity.","question":"At which point are people resistent to a wider range of temperature?","options":"When sleeping|When exercising","correct":"When exercising","audio_file":"75_FILLER.mp3"},{"item_id":76,"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"Seeing Peter slowly advancing upon him through the air with dagger poised, he sprang upon the bulwarks to cast himself into the sea.","question":"Did the man escape Peter's attempt to attack?","options":"Yes|No","correct":"Yes","audio_file":"76_FILLER.mp3"},{"item_id":77,"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"Some months later, Michael Larson saw another opportunity to stack the odds in his favor with a dash of ingenuity.","question":"Did Larson see more than one opportunity?","options":"Yes|No","correct":"Yes","audio_file":"77_FILLER.mp3"},{"item_id":78,"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"Bob Murphy, the Senior PGA Tour money leader with seven hundred thousand, says heat shouldn't be a factor.","question":"Is the leader cocnered about the weather?","options":"Yes|No","correct":"No","audio_file":"78_FILLER.mp3"},{"item_id":79,"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"Greg Anderson, considered a key witness by the prosecution, vowed he wouldn't testify when served a subpoena last week.","question":"Was Greg Anderson asked to testify?","options":"Yes|No","correct":"Yes","audio_file":"79_FILLER.mp3"},{"item_id":80,"condition_id":"FILLER1","text":"Owls are more flexible than humans because a bird's head is only connected by one socket pivot.","question":"Are humans less flexible than owls?","options":"Yes|No","correct":"Yes","audio_file":"80_FILLER.mp3"}]